WEBVTT

00:04.280 --> 00:09.820
<i>Due to heavy rain, the next train is running
 about twenty minutes behind.</i>

00:10.390 --> 00:14.950
<i>We sincerely apologize for the 
delay in service today.</i>

00:18.400 --> 00:19.810
I-I'm sorry!

00:19.810 --> 00:20.880
It's okay.

00:22.740 --> 00:25.410
The train sure is late, huh?

00:25.410 --> 00:28.750
Yeah. I'm getting sleepy just waiting.

00:29.730 --> 00:33.450
<i>But I'm glad she's still here with me.</i>

00:34.570 --> 00:38.840
<i>Today, we kissed for the first time.</i>

00:51.050 --> 00:53.900
<i>This... isn't a dream, is it?</i>

00:58.520 --> 01:04.040
<i>If I could tell my old self that 
we'd really fall in love,</i>

01:04.680 --> 01:06.590
<i>I wonder how I'd react.</i>

02:43.390 --> 02:49.390
<b>Episode 12</b>

02:43.390 --> 02:49.390
<b>My First Love</b>

02:43.520 --> 02:46.610
Whoa! Here. Here!

02:46.610 --> 02:50.060
Let me guess. 
Do you have a crush on that girl?

02:51.310 --> 02:52.300
Huh?

02:52.570 --> 02:55.870
You've been watching her this 
whole time, haven't you?

02:58.250 --> 03:00.050
Hit it higher!

02:58.610 --> 03:00.480
I see now.

03:00.480 --> 03:05.530
No wonder you keep coming out here 
in the cold. That explains it.

03:05.530 --> 03:10.430
N-No, you're wrong! I don't really... 
have a crush on her.

03:10.750 --> 03:16.310
She just picked up something 
for me I dropped the other day.

03:16.310 --> 03:17.760
Hmm...

03:18.580 --> 03:19.770
Sorry!

03:19.770 --> 03:20.770
It's okay, it's okay!

03:21.100 --> 03:22.580
Goodness.

03:22.580 --> 03:23.760
Excuse me!

03:25.090 --> 03:28.000
Just be careful not to hit 
it into the road, okay?

03:28.000 --> 03:30.380
All right. Thank you very much.

03:31.890 --> 03:33.900
<b>A Boy's Chair</b>

03:36.950 --> 03:38.440
Thanks for waiting!

03:37.600 --> 03:39.810
Now that's one nice girl.

03:38.440 --> 03:39.910
Sorry!

03:39.810 --> 03:42.370
Really? She just seems normal to me.

03:42.370 --> 03:44.940
You sure don't get it, youngster.

03:45.230 --> 03:48.120
It's normal to help people in need.

03:48.830 --> 03:51.540
If you do something wrong, 
it's normal to apologize.

03:52.060 --> 03:53.580
Remember to say thank you.

03:54.320 --> 04:00.110
But it's actually pretty difficult 
to do "normal" things all the time.

04:05.280 --> 04:06.590
I'm home.

04:07.200 --> 04:10.860
Listen, Saki is just about to graduate.

04:11.200 --> 04:14.110
He studied so hard for his entrance exam.

04:14.110 --> 04:16.100
You should come home for a while.

04:16.890 --> 04:19.860
Oh, Saki-kun. Welcome home.

04:17.640 --> 04:19.860
Oh dear. Are you really going to say that?

04:19.860 --> 04:21.650
Thank you, Auntie.

04:22.170 --> 04:25.180
Is that my mom on the phone?

04:25.180 --> 04:28.930
Um, well, yes. But they're having 
a bit of an argument.

04:29.410 --> 04:32.160
I'm not sure you'll get to talk to her today.

04:33.770 --> 04:35.540
Ah! There, there!

04:35.540 --> 04:39.220
For goodness sake!
He's your son, you stubborn fool!

04:44.170 --> 04:46.270
Welcome home, Saki.

04:46.830 --> 04:48.090
Thank you.

04:54.120 --> 04:56.910
I can't find that monster anywhere!

04:57.520 --> 04:59.010
Oh, I just saw him.

04:59.010 --> 05:00.550
Really? Where is he?

05:00.550 --> 05:01.400
Here, here.

05:02.600 --> 05:06.170
Did you hear? Yao-kun asked 
a girl in class 2 out!

05:06.170 --> 05:08.540
Wow! He's got guts!

05:08.540 --> 05:13.060
And then you know what?

05:09.490 --> 05:12.490
Um... We still have cleaning to do.

05:15.570 --> 05:19.050
<i>I guess she doesn't like interrupting 
when people are talking.</i>

05:19.930 --> 05:22.160
<i>I can kind of relate.</i>

05:23.080 --> 05:27.720
<i>But why do I keep thinking 
about her so much?</i>

05:33.050 --> 05:35.690
The book I just borrowed 
is really interesting!

05:35.060 --> 05:37.940
<b>A Boy's Chair</b>

05:35.690 --> 05:37.430
Oh? What kind of book is it?

05:42.950 --> 05:45.600
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

05:57.450 --> 06:00.910
<i>Was she too shy to talk 
to that lady at first?</i>

06:01.630 --> 06:07.380
<i>It's actually pretty difficult 
to do "normal" things all the time.</i>

06:10.970 --> 06:13.460
You're all going to be graduating soon.

06:14.100 --> 06:17.490
So today, I'd like to give 
you a special assignment.

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
Feb.14th

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
PE

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
Japanese

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
Math

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
English

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
English

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
Home Ec

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
Homeroom

06:16.730 --> 06:19.480
Art

06:18.060 --> 06:23.290
Some of you might end up at different 
middle schools than your friends.

06:22.610 --> 06:26.610
Name

06:22.610 --> 06:26.610
Birthday

06:22.610 --> 06:26.610
Star Sign/Blood Type

06:22.610 --> 06:26.610
Dreams

06:22.610 --> 06:26.610
Someone I Like

06:22.610 --> 06:26.610
Something I Like

06:23.750 --> 06:28.280
So before you graduate, 
I want you to exchange these cards

06:28.280 --> 06:31.480
with at least three people you 
want to stay in touch with.

06:34.470 --> 06:39.490
<i>It's not like I have any friends. Can I 
give them to people outside of school?</i>

07:01.180 --> 07:05.020
U-Um... Is this yours?

07:05.020 --> 07:06.030
Oh!

07:08.080 --> 07:09.570
Y-Yeah!

07:16.740 --> 07:20.550
That card... We go to the same school, right?

07:21.050 --> 07:23.580
That old man isn't here with you today.

07:23.890 --> 07:25.840
<i>She talked to me!</i>

07:26.990 --> 07:29.910
U-Um, well...

07:32.360 --> 07:35.460
Are you going to give that card to someone?

07:36.620 --> 07:43.220
I-I don't have any... m-many friends, so...

07:46.190 --> 07:47.580
Neither do I.

07:48.910 --> 07:53.730
I was worried I wouldn't have 
anyone to give my last one to.

07:54.040 --> 07:56.870
If it's okay with you, want 
to exchange cards with me?

07:56.870 --> 07:59.380
H-Huh?! Really?

08:03.410 --> 08:06.210
But I haven't filled mine out yet.

08:06.210 --> 08:09.860
That's okay! Just give it 
to me at school later.

08:10.960 --> 08:13.980
Can I just ask what your name is?

08:13.980 --> 08:17.510
Mine's Hotaru. Hinase Hotaru.

08:17.830 --> 08:24.780
M-My name is Sa... Saki.

08:25.080 --> 08:27.020
Sasaki-kun, huh?

08:27.020 --> 08:29.200
<i>What?! That's not right!</i>

08:27.020 --> 08:29.480
If I correct her now, it might embarrass her!

08:31.450 --> 08:34.840
Okay, I'll see you at school, Sasaki-kun!

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Name: Hinase Hotaru

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
I don't have a cell phone.

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Birthday

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
December 24th

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Star Sign/Blood Type

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Capricorn, Type O

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Dreams

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Eating yummy food from around the world

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Something I like

08:39.490 --> 08:43.000
Food
Fluffy things

08:49.500 --> 08:51.030
Name: Hinase Hotaru

08:49.500 --> 08:51.030
I don't have a cell phone.

08:49.500 --> 08:51.030
Birthday

08:49.500 --> 08:51.030
December 24th

08:49.500 --> 08:51.030
Star Sign/Blood Type

08:49.500 --> 08:51.030
Capricorn, Type O

08:50.880 --> 08:57.240
<i>I wish... I wish I could get 
a girl like her to like me.</i>

08:57.920 --> 09:02.660
<i>I wish she could be my soulmate.</i>

09:06.880 --> 09:12.920
<i>What should I do? It's already March, 
and I haven't given her my card yet.</i>

09:13.530 --> 09:16.160
<i>I want to give it to her when we're alone.</i>

09:16.610 --> 09:18.530
Hey, isn't that Yao-kun?

09:18.530 --> 09:22.320
Oh, you're right! 
But who's that girl with him?

09:22.850 --> 09:24.410
Huh? No way!

09:37.260 --> 09:39.680
Graduation day is

09:40.660 --> 09:45.180
<i>At this rate, I'm not going to get this
 to her before graduation.</i>

09:41.680 --> 09:45.180
Name: Hananoi Saki

09:47.940 --> 09:50.920
<i>Her shoes are still here!</i>

09:52.880 --> 09:55.140
<i>Okay, I'll see you at school!</i>

09:58.990 --> 10:01.300
<i>If she's in the classroom, 
I'll give it to her.</i>

10:01.300 --> 10:03.700
<i>If she's in the classroom, 
I'll give it to her!</i>

10:03.700 --> 10:06.750
<i>If she's in the classroom... 
I'll give it to her!</i>

10:12.670 --> 10:14.950
I told you all about how I felt, Hotaru-chan!

10:14.950 --> 10:17.020
<i>There's somebody else in there.</i>

10:17.020 --> 10:21.220
I told you he was my dream. 
I told you I was really in love!

10:21.760 --> 10:25.020
But you... But you...

10:25.410 --> 10:30.010
You didn't consider my feelings 
at all, Hotaru-chan.

10:55.310 --> 10:57.640
Oh? You sure are late.

10:58.110 --> 11:00.170
I thought you might not show up today.

11:01.230 --> 11:04.430
I'm... a horrible person.

11:04.430 --> 11:08.550
What's all this now? Did something 
bad happen at school?

11:09.560 --> 11:12.520
I should have stopped it.

11:12.950 --> 11:17.320
I should have gotten a teacher. 
I should have tried to cheer her up.

11:17.840 --> 11:20.760
I should have done something. I couldn't.

11:22.830 --> 11:28.100
Instead, I left her crying 
all by herself. I...

11:29.440 --> 11:30.320
I...

11:41.000 --> 11:43.180
I couldn't do anything for her!

11:44.540 --> 11:48.320
I never should have started liking her!

11:49.820 --> 11:54.680
I don't know what happened, 
but have yourself a good cry, sonny.

11:55.860 --> 12:00.310
Despair is what teaches us how to grow up.

12:03.580 --> 12:09.240
But you know, you shouldn't feel bad 
for liking her. That isn't right.

12:09.240 --> 12:12.580
Love is something you just fall into.

12:13.830 --> 12:19.370
There's no such thing as someone
who shouldn't fall in love.

12:24.780 --> 12:26.180
<i>Thank you for your patience.</i>

12:26.600 --> 12:29.960
<i>The train will arrive at 
platform one momentarily.</i>

12:31.600 --> 12:35.450
Oh, s-sorry! When did I fall asleep?

12:35.450 --> 12:38.720
Good morning. It's totally okay.

12:38.720 --> 12:41.200
It was a nice little bonus, honestly.

12:41.200 --> 12:43.130
I'm just trying to process my joy.

12:43.130 --> 12:44.700
J-Joy?

12:45.520 --> 12:47.870
Yeah. I'm happy.

12:49.390 --> 12:53.350
<i>I never thought I'd ever see her again.</i>

12:54.560 --> 12:59.190
<i>I never thought she'd talk to me again.</i>

13:00.380 --> 13:02.380
<b>Local Train</b>

13:00.380 --> 13:02.380
<b>20 Minute Delay</b>

13:00.380 --> 13:02.380
<b>Train will be arriving momentarily</b>

13:02.390 --> 13:05.130
All right, I'll see you tomorrow.

13:05.480 --> 13:06.320
Yeah.

13:11.550 --> 13:12.900
See you tomorrow.

13:15.320 --> 13:16.220
Hmm?

13:16.220 --> 13:19.680
No, I was just thinking about 
everything that happened today.

13:21.260 --> 13:25.620
Um, anyway, I look forward 
to keep seeing you tomorrow on, too!

13:26.170 --> 13:27.190
Sure.

13:27.710 --> 13:30.680
<i>I never thought we'd fall in love.</i>

13:31.800 --> 13:38.130
<i>But actually, I never bothered to ask 
what happens after you're in love.</i>

13:39.260 --> 13:43.250
<i>I was too focused on simply falling in love.</i>

13:46.830 --> 13:51.080
<i>I never thought about what comes next.</i>

13:53.860 --> 13:59.470
<i>My past is full of regrets. Will I ever 
be able to talk to you about that?</i>

14:00.730 --> 14:09.850
<i>If that day comes, this time, will I finally 
have become someone worthy of you?</i>

14:13.050 --> 14:17.910
Hananoi-kun, I tried making sweets today!

14:17.910 --> 14:20.850
Wow! I'm so happy!

14:22.470 --> 14:26.730
Hotaru-chan, you have some 
cream on your cheek.

14:35.220 --> 14:39.190
I-I had another really weird dream!

14:40.050 --> 14:44.950
<i>The other day, Hananoi-kun and I 
had our first kiss.</i>

14:45.550 --> 14:47.460
<i>The aftermath is intense!</i>

14:48.140 --> 14:49.370
Hotaru-chan?

14:50.530 --> 14:52.120
Are you feeling down today?

14:52.120 --> 14:54.710
N-No, not at all!

14:54.710 --> 14:57.720
Oh, the movie is gonna 
start soon. We should go!

14:58.870 --> 15:00.070
You're right.

15:07.870 --> 15:12.150
<i>This isn't the first time we've held hands, 
but my heart always starts pounding!</i>

15:13.030 --> 15:17.100
<i>But it's more than excitement. 
I'm just so happy.</i>

15:17.890 --> 15:21.460
<i>Is this what it means to like someone?</i>

15:22.370 --> 15:26.200
<i>It's strange. I used to be
 so scared.</i>

15:26.890 --> 15:28.630
Hmm? Is something wrong?

15:28.630 --> 15:30.200
No.

15:32.670 --> 15:36.380
I'm just so happy right now!

16:02.360 --> 16:06.530
Why are all of the rings 
here lined up in pairs?

16:06.530 --> 16:09.270
Oh, because they're for couples.

16:09.270 --> 16:10.670
They are?!

16:11.150 --> 16:13.140
Would you like to try one on?

16:13.140 --> 16:13.930
Huh?!

16:15.290 --> 16:16.800
Wow!

16:17.270 --> 16:21.290
If you put these rings together,
 they form a heart.

16:21.290 --> 16:22.910
Well, Hotaru-chan?

16:23.700 --> 16:26.270
It's a very unfamiliar feeling!

16:26.270 --> 16:27.910
Unfamiliar, huh?

16:29.890 --> 16:33.180
<i>Maybe a simpler design would be better.</i>

16:36.760 --> 16:42.180
U-Um, is this the sort of thing 
people wear when they're in love?

16:42.180 --> 16:45.180
They're popular with students as well.

16:45.180 --> 16:49.540
B-But it might be a little too soon for us.

16:49.540 --> 16:54.750
Are you sure? I still think it's a lovely 
thing to celebrate your feelings.

16:57.690 --> 16:59.430
Do you like them after all?

17:00.600 --> 17:04.580
If it's all right, I'd like 
to give you one as a present.

17:04.890 --> 17:08.840
N-No, that's okay. They seem expensive...

17:08.840 --> 17:10.420
<i>They're </i>super<i> expensive!</i>

17:13.270 --> 17:15.470
Please stop by again sometime!

17:20.710 --> 17:25.130
<i>I guess that was too much. 
Maybe a ring is overdoing it.</i>

17:33.860 --> 17:34.650
Oh.

17:36.890 --> 17:38.360
Hotaru-chan?

17:46.370 --> 17:52.540
S-Say, why don't we each buy 
matching ones here?

17:54.300 --> 17:55.680
Wow.

17:56.520 --> 17:59.380
I've never worn a ring before.

17:59.380 --> 18:01.800
Let's be careful not to lose them, okay?

18:05.340 --> 18:06.690
I'm so happy.

18:07.560 --> 18:11.770
I was worried this sort of thing 
would embarrass you, Hotaru-chan.

18:12.340 --> 18:17.480
I don't know. It's kind of nice to 
commemorate our feelings like this.

18:23.720 --> 18:27.290
I never knew what this felt like.

18:27.290 --> 18:28.030
Huh?

18:28.540 --> 18:32.540
That just holding hands could be so exciting.

18:32.960 --> 18:37.260
The desire to make 
someone dear to you smile.

18:37.760 --> 18:42.510
Or how much courage it takes
to confess your feelings to someone.

18:46.080 --> 18:50.060
I don't ever want to forget how that feels.

18:53.590 --> 18:58.560
As long as I'm wearing this, 
I'll remember whenever I look at it.

18:59.350 --> 19:03.080
Oh! I'm a bit embarrassed I said that...

19:03.720 --> 19:05.320
No, not at all.

19:22.870 --> 19:24.630
Not even a little.

19:26.960 --> 19:31.840
It sure is funny, though. 
I was so scared of falling in love.

19:33.600 --> 19:39.080
Hananoi-kun, you taught me what love is.

19:39.080 --> 19:40.190
Thank you!

19:51.660 --> 19:53.350
I'm the one who's grateful.

19:58.340 --> 20:01.600
For falling in love with me...

20:02.420 --> 20:03.460
Thank you.

20:13.640 --> 20:14.570
Are you o—

20:41.230 --> 20:43.050
Was I making a weird fa—

20:59.410 --> 21:00.630
Not weird at all.

21:01.700 --> 21:04.780
Sorry. You're just so cute, I couldn't resist.

21:06.150 --> 21:09.150
I like you so much, Hotaru-chan.

22:52.270 --> 22:54.240
Good morning, Hotaru-chan.

22:54.240 --> 22:56.510
Good morning, Hananoi-kun!

22:57.890 --> 23:00.750
<i>My name is Hinase Hotaru.
I'm sixteen years old.</i>

23:03.470 --> 23:06.930
<i>And Hananoi-kun and I...</i>

23:11.760 --> 23:13.480
<i>We're in love!</i>

23:20.080 --> 23:25.080
Thanks so much for watching!

23:20.420 --> 23:22.350
Ready?

23:22.350 --> 23:24.440
Thank you very much!
